		"title": "The transcript after a retry",
		"kind": "text",
		"request": "Transcript-Hash(ClientHello1, HelloRetryRequest, ClientHello2, ...) =\nHash( message_hash || 00 00 Hash.length || Hash(ClientHello1)\n      || HelloRetryRequest || ClientHello2 || ... )",
